k8086 emulator (Git submodule)
------------------------------
`emulator/k8086/` is a Git submodule of
[k8086](https://github.com/Trugath/k8086) (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026
Elliot Stirling). It ships its own LICENSE, NOTICE, and third-party notices
(including the IBM CGA font and optional SingleStepTests corpora). Initialize
with `./setup.sh` or `git submodule update --init emulator/k8086`. Do not use
`--recursive` unless you intentionally want the large SingleStepTests checkouts.

Behavioral compatibility notes
------------------------------
The system BIOS aims for software compatibility with IBM PC/XT expectations
(socket map, IVT/BDA, service interrupts, pinned entry points). The IBM 5160
Technical Reference and open XT BIOS projects such as
[pcxtbios](https://github.com/virtualxt/pcxtbios/) may be consulted as
behavioral references. Their source is not vendored or copied into this tree.

Guest shutdown via I/O port `0x8900` (ASCII `Shutdown`) follows the common
Bochs/QEMU-style convention used by k8086; no Bochs or QEMU source is included.
